    "hash": "10d3a3e02305f9fe1743adb6da9cdfc18709c1fbd10294f4f46441a8bb781089",
    "summary_one_sentence": "A group of misfit high school students unwittingly unleashes a terrifying curse when they blow an ancient Aztec Death Whistle, summoning physical manifestations of their future deaths to hunt them down.",
    "summary_short": "When a group of outcast high school students accidentally discover an ancient Aztec Death Whistle, they unwittingly trigger a malevolent curse. The eerie sound emitted by the artifact summons relentless, terrifying manifestations of their future deaths to hunt them down one by one. As panic sets in, the teenagers must band together and investigate the origin of the cursed object. Together, they face a race against time to figure out how to destroy the artifact before their fates are sealed.",
    "summary_long": "A group of misfit high school students accidentally stumbles upon a sinister artifact known as an ancient Aztec Death Whistle. Driven by curiosity, they blow into the object, completely unaware that its bone-chilling sound carries a malevolent curse. Soon after, the teenagers begin experiencing unsettling paranormal events and harrowing visions foretelling their individual demises. They quickly realize that the whistle's terrifying sound has summoned physical manifestations of their future deaths, which are now relentlessly stalking them. As panic spreads and members of the group begin falling victim to their inescapable fates, the survivors scramble to find answers. Desperate to survive, the remaining teens delve into historical research to uncover the origins of the Death Whistle and the dark magic behind it. Their investigation reveals a grim history of ancient sacrifices and supernatural horrors tied directly to the artifact. Forced to confront their deepest fears and personal drama while evading monstrous hunters, the group formulates a desperate plan to shatter the curse. Ultimately, they must make unthinkable sacrifices in a final bid to destroy the whistle before their time runs out completely.",
    "synopsis": "Whistle is a chilling supernatural horror film that blends ancient folklore with high school drama. The story follows a band of misfit high school students who accidentally come into possession of a mysterious Aztec Death Whistle. Unaware of its supernatural properties, blowing the artifact unleashes a dreadful curse: its harrowing scream summons the very manifestations of their impending future deaths. As the unearthly entities begin hunting the teenagers one by one, the survivors must solve the mystery behind the ancient relic and break the curse before their fates are permanently sealed.",
